{"id":"n71206-1-8","stage":2,"title":"장가 · 娶妻","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71206-1-8-1","ko":"시아주버님은 왜 아직 장가를 안 가셨대요?","zh":"您丈夫的哥哥怎么还没结婚？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시아주버님은","meaning":"丈夫的哥哥（敬称）","explanation":"시아주버니：丈夫的哥哥；님：敬称后缀；은：提示话题。","readings":[{"term":"시아주버니","audio":"/audio/9c61c626c98922130572.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65999","senseId":"1","lemma":"시아주버니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장가를","meaning":"娶妻","explanation":"장가：娶妻；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장가","audio":"/audio/085538033a092a404072.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71206","senseId":"1","lemma":"장가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가셨대요?","meaning":"去世","explanation":"가다：去世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"34","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9c61c626c9892213","term":"시아주버니","zh":"丈夫的哥哥","audio":"/audio/9c61c626c98922130572.mp3","entryId":"65999","definition":"丈夫的哥哥","pronunciation":["시아주버니"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"085538033a092a40","term":"장가","zh":"娶妻","audio":"/audio/085538033a092a404072.mp3","entryId":"71206","definition":"男人娶媳妇。","pronunciation":["장ː가"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去世","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"人死。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4efff8652a0f2995ee96.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71206-1-8-2","ko":"여자에 관심이 없고 일에만 빠져 사느라 나이만 들었어요.","zh":"他不关心谈恋爱，只顾工作，年龄就这么大了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여자에","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관심이","meaning":"关注，关心，兴趣","explanation":"관심：关注，关心，兴趣；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60096","senseId":"1","lemma":"관심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없고","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일에만","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠져","meaning":"沉迷，沉浸，坠入","explanation":"빠지다：沉迷，沉浸，坠入；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71273","senseId":"5","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사느라","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；느라：说明因忙于前一动作而出现后续情况，常接不利结果。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이만","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었어요.","meaning":"上(年纪)","explanation":"들다：上(年纪)；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"19","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"07b3c15a29688a55","term":"관심","zh":"关注，关心，兴趣","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3","entryId":"60096","definition":"被某种东西吸引的情感和想法。","pronunciation":["관심"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"沉迷，沉浸，坠入","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"71273","definition":"精神过度地倾注于某处。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"上(年纪)","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"年龄增长。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5277c11feb408f73cd4f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.679,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71206","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4043,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他不关心谈恋爱，只顾工作，年龄就这么大了。","您丈夫的哥哥怎么还没结婚？","那家店为什么挤满了人啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您丈夫的哥哥怎么还没结婚？","那家店为什么挤满了人啊？","他不关心谈恋爱，只顾工作，年龄就这么大了。"],"answer":2}]}
